WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.701 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-New York City, baby!

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:04.537 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:07.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
My name is Mike.
I'm in my 40s.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:07.841 line:92%
Some of you might be younger

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I'll tell you what it's lik
to be in your 40s.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:11.344 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whether I lift weights
or get drunk,

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
my body feels about the same
the next day.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.517 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'm just achy and sore,

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
questioning all of
my life choices.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.353 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.522
My father gave me
some very bad advice growing up,

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.724
but it's gonna sound like
good advice when I say it.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
But now that I'm in my 40s
I know it's bad.

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.362 size:75% position:38% line:92%
This was the advice.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "Michael,
always give 100%."

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:36.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "You can't go wrong
if you always give 100%."

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.105 line:92%
That, my friends, is false

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:39.839 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.908 line:92%
If you give 100% at all times,

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
you will end up
in a mental institution.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.347 line:92%
But you have to try sometimes.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:50.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
So what I do now is,
when I walk into a situation

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.485 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I check my cellphone.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whatever percentage
my battery is at...

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.256 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
...that's how much effort
I give.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.128 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:05.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tonight, they were like, "Mike
this crowd deserves 100%."

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:08.134
I said,
"37% is what they're gonna get."

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:09.436 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.905 line:92%
"Unless somebody has a charger."

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:17.644 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm not married.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:23.116
There's a lot of lies floating
around out there about marriage.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.985 line:92%
One is that marriage is 50/50.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
I find that to be
not true at all.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:32.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
The marriages that last
are never 50/50.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
The marriages that last
are a combination

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:37.263 size:84% position:42% line:92%
of two types of people.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.632 line:92%
One person who is boring..

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:40.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
...with another person
who is crazy.

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:43.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:48.741
Boring and crazy is the only
combination that seems to work

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.344 line:92%
I've done the math on this

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.145 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Two borings don't work.

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
They'll cheat on each other.
Not enough excitement.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
Two crazies don't work
'cause that's the show "Cops."

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:04.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you ever seen
the show "Cops"?

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been through
a lot of breakups.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:09.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when I break up
with a woman, never pleasant

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.898 line:92%
I like to do it at a restaurant.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:12.432 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:13.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I feel like
it's a public place

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she will not cause a scene
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
But can I share a secret
with you guys?

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:24.210
The women of today will yell
at you right in a restaurant

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.912 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:26.646 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So you know what I do?

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:29.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
I take her
to a Chinese restaurant.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:30.884 line:92%
That way if she yells at me,

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:33.486
it just seems like
she's working at the restaurant.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:42.495 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.430 line:92%
I'm trying to stay in shape.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
I started doing hot yoga
last spring.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
And one of the benefits
of doing hot yoga in New Yor

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:53.406
is that you get to carry a small
mat around the city with you

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I like that,
'cause my friends are dumb

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like,
"Are you doing yoga?"

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.282 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I'm like, "This? No.

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:03.383 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I like to engage people

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
in tiny wrestling matches
all over town."

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:06.719 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:07.854 line:92%
That's how I work out now.

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:11.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
I start a confrontation.
I roll out the mat.

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:11.691 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.993
I wave on the challenge.
I'm like, "Bring it, dawg!

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's solve it in this
2 by 1 by 2 by 1-inch spac

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:21.668
that I carry around with m
for aggressive reasons."

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:24.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:28.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
I complain about hot yoga
being too hot.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:29.876 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I'm one of those guys.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:30.543 size:75% position:38% line:92%
My friends are like,

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Mike, why don't you just
go to regular yoga?"

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:34.514 line:92%
I'm like, "No, I like hot yoga

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:37.217 size:88% position:44%
I like hot yoga because
you're sweating so much,

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
no one can tell
that you're crying."

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:40.253 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like,
"Mike, are you chanting?"

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:43.389 line:92%
I'm like, "I am weeping."

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.258 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:46.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
I told the instructor
it was too hot.

00:03:46.693 --> 00:03:49.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's supposed to be 90 minutes
105 degrees,

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:51.564 size:81% position:41% line:92%
but it feels like 140.

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:52.599 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's what I said.

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:54.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
She said,
"The seasons are changing.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:57.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
We kind of have to adjust
to the seasons."

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.472 size:81% position:41%
I'm like, "Do you know
how buildings work?"

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:00.006 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:03.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You control the weather
on the inside of a building.

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:06.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why it's different
from the outside of a building

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
Otherwise,
we would not need buildings.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:12.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
We would just
do everything outside."

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:13.319 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's like, "But don't you fee
better after it's over?"

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.724
I'm like, "I feel better the way
that someone feels better

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:20.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
after they've survived
a car accident."

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.094 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.996 line:92%
"I feel better that I'm alive.

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:26.566
But I don't feel better than i
I never would have come here."

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:27.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's like,
"But you're losing weight.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:31.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
Aren't you happy
that you're losing weight?

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:32.438 line:92%
I'm like, "Am I losing weight?

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:36.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't feel like
I'm losing weight.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.977 line:92%
I feel like I'm evaporating.

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:38.778 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:39.646 line:92%
"Feel like that's happening.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like there's
a cloud outside

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:43.049 line:92%
that looks exactly like me

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.817 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Fat, white, and sad."

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:45.351 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.754 size:78% position:39%
You guys are amazing.
Thank you so much!

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:51.124 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:54.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How's it going, dude?
-It's good.

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:55.762 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mike Vecchione!

00:04:55.762 --> 00:04:57.764 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

